WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.810
How have places in Asia turned heat risk into a plan?

2
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:11.690
At three scales. A whole city, in Ahmedabad. Ward by ward, in Thane. And state-wide, in Tamil Nadu.

3
00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:16.120
Each shows what was decided, what changed, and who leads.

4
00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:20.620
Plans worth borrowing from.
